{"source": "technique:string_gauge_adjustment", "relation": "constrains", "target": "caution:tension_balance_and_neck_health", "knowledge_type": "Caution", "confidence": 0.9, "context_condition": "长期采用非标准调弦（特别是大幅升降音）进行编曲或录音时", "review_note": "为保持最佳音色响应和琴颈稳定性，升调应换用更细琴弦以降低张力，降调应换用更粗琴弦以维持张力；短期微调可使用标准规格，但长期特殊调弦需匹配物理张力。", "evidence": "升调弦...使用更细规格的琴弦；降调弦...则使用更粗规格的琴弦", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0004:004", "chunk_id": "chunk_0004", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "pattern:movable_shapes_in_open_tuning", "relation": "enables", "target": "guitar_idiom:barre_chord_transposition", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.85, "context_condition": "在开放式调弦中构建和弦进行或快速转调时", "review_note": "开放式调弦的优势在于其和弦指型具有高度的可移动性（Movable Shapes），基于开放弦设计的指型可以在指板上平移以适应不同调性，简化了转调和声部编写的复杂度。", "evidence": "所有指型均可移动，适用于不同调性的音乐...基于开放调弦本身设计", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0004:005", "chunk_id": "chunk_0004", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "concept:standard_tuning_intervals", "relation": "conflicts_with", "target": "color:full_harmonic_resonance", "knowledge_type": "Caution", "confidence": 0.75, "context_condition": "评估标准调弦在扫弦或全弦鸣响时的和声纯净度时", "review_note": "标准调弦主要由四度构成，仅有一处三度，导致空弦全奏时并非一个清晰的协和和弦（虽可视为Em11但排列不佳），因此在追求极致和谐共鸣的编曲段落中，标准调弦可能不如开放调弦理想。", "evidence": "标准调弦...主要由四度音程构成...该和弦的排列方式实际听感并不理想", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0004:006", "chunk_id": "chunk_0004", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "tuning:daeac#e", "relation": "enables", "target": "guitar_idiom:open_string_resonance", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.85, "context_condition": "在 DAEAC#E 开放调弦下编写和弦 Voicing 或分解和弦时", "review_note": "该调弦法利用空弦音（D-A-E-A-C#-E）构建和声，使得即使使用简单指型也能获得‘音色浑然一体’的共鸣效果。编曲时应优先利用空弦作为持续音（Pedal Tone）或和弦内音，以最大化共振色彩，减少左手按弦负担并增加声部厚度。", "evidence": "均基于开放调弦法设计，音色浑然⼀体", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0005:001", "chunk_id": "chunk_0005", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "tuning:daeac#e", "relation": "suggests", "target": "heuristic:movable_shape_voicing", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.8, "context_condition": "在 DAEAC#E 调弦下进行转调或模进编配时", "review_note": "由于是开放调弦，基础指型（如大九、小九、属七等）具有高度的可移动性。编曲时可将其视为‘ barre chord ’的变体，通过整体把位移动快速生成不同调性的复杂和声（如 Maj9, m9），无需重新计算每个和弦的指法，适合快速构建和声进行。", "evidence": "所有指型可移动变调，适⽤于不同调式音乐", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0005:002", "chunk_id": "chunk_0005", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "scale_pattern:non_linear_fingering", "relation": "cautions", "target": "caution:interval_consistency_check", "knowledge_type": "Caution", "confidence": 0.75, "context_condition": "在非标准调弦（如 DAEAC#E）中编写旋律线或独奏乐句时", "review_note": "特殊调弦导致指板上的音阶排列不再遵循标准调弦的线性逻辑，换弦时音符可能重复或跳跃。编曲旋律时必须依赖听觉验证音程关系的连续性，不能直接套用标准调弦的指型记忆，需警惕因指法惯性导致的音准错误或非预期音程。", "evidence": "这些音符并非完全连续排列，意味着换弦时某些音符会重复出现...只需凭借听觉即可轻松梳理", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0005:003", "chunk_id": "chunk_0005", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "genre:math_rock_contemporary", "relation": "evokes", "target": "color:melodic_consonance", "knowledge_type": "ColorEmotion", "confidence": 0.7, "context_condition": "创作现代数学摇滚（Math Rock）风格乐曲时", "review_note": "与现代流行音乐类似，当代数学摇滚倾向于使用同一调号下的自然音阶和弦，强调旋律性和和谐感，而非早期数学摇滚的不和谐特征。编曲时应避免过度使用无调性或极度不协和音程，转而追求清晰的调性中心和流畅的旋律线条。", "evidence": "现代数学摇滚⼤多旋律性强...通常都使⽤同⼀调号下的和弦与音符...与流⾏音乐相似", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0005:004", "chunk_id": "chunk_0005", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
