{"source": "chord:dominant_7th", "relation": "constrains", "target": "genre:jazz_blues_progression", "knowledge_type": "Caution", "confidence": 0.8, "context_condition": "在数学摇滚等现代风格编曲中处理属七和弦时", "review_note": "教材提示属七和弦在数学化风格中较少见，而在爵士蓝调中大量使用。这暗示了在非传统风格中需谨慎使用属七，避免产生过于传统的解决倾向从而破坏风格统一性。", "evidence": "属和弦...在数学化⻛格中较少⻅（爵⼠与蓝调中⼤量使⽤）", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0006:003", "chunk_id": "chunk_0006", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "technique:omit_notes_in_extensions", "relation": "suggests", "target": "heuristic:keep_7th_in_extensions", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.95, "context_condition": "在吉他指板上编排九度、十一度或十三度等扩展和弦Voicing时", "review_note": "由于吉他只有六根弦且手指有限，必须省略音符。教材强调‘七度音是从不被省略的’，这是构建扩展和弦Voicing的核心规则，确保和弦性质（大七/属七/小七）不被混淆。", "evidence": "七度音是从不被省略的...演奏时往往会省略和弦中较不重要的音符", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0006:004", "chunk_id": "chunk_0006", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "technique:omit_notes_in_extensions", "relation": "suggests", "target": "heuristic:omit_5th_for_space", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.9, "context_condition": "在吉他指板上编排包含9th/11th/13th的扩展和弦Voicing时", "review_note": "为了在有限的指板空间内容纳扩展音，五度音（5th）通常是首选被省略的音符，因为它对和弦色彩的影响最小，从而为9/11/13度音腾出位置。", "evidence": "5th... [in omission list for extended chords]", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0006:005", "chunk_id": "chunk_0006", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
