{"source": "heuristic:voice_leading_proximity", "relation": "enables", "target": "guitar_idiom:minimal_fretboard_movement", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.9, "context_condition": "编配和弦进行（Chord Progression）的吉他声部连接时", "review_note": "教材指出在和弦转换中选择‘最邻近配置’（nearest configuration）能减少指板跳跃并保持流畅感。这对AI编曲至关重要：在生成多小节和弦谱时，应优先选择与前一个和弦共享品位或相邻品位的Voicing，以降低演奏难度并优化声部线性连接，除非刻意追求大跳带来的戏剧性效果。", "evidence": "和弦进⾏间的转换通常通过移动到特定和弦的最邻近配置来实现...保持整体流畅感，以及减少吉他⼿的演奏负担", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0007:001", "chunk_id": "chunk_0007", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "chord_quality:extended_7th_and_9th", "relation": "evokes", "target": "style:math_rock_and_emocore", "knowledge_type": "ColorEmotion", "confidence": 0.85, "context_condition": "为数学摇滚（Math Rock）或情绪核（Emo-core）风格编写吉他Riff或伴奏织体时", "review_note": "明确指出了扩展七和弦与九和弦在特定现代风格（数摇/情绪核）中的核心地位。AI在识别或生成此类风格标签时，应提高延伸音和弦（尤其是Maj7, m7, dom7, add9/maj9）的权重，而非仅使用三和弦。", "evidence": "延伸的七和弦与九和弦在数学摇滚及受情绪核影响的数学摇滚⻛格中最为实⽤且适⽤", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0007:002", "chunk_id": "chunk_0007", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "technique:intentional_large_leaps", "relation": "can_inspire", "target": "arrangement_strategy:dramatic_textural_shift", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.75, "context_condition": "需要打破常规流畅感，制造听觉惊喜或段落对比时", "review_note": "教材提到‘若有意为之，通过更⼤的和弦跳跃也能实现有趣效果’。这提示AI不应将‘最小移动’视为绝对约束，而在需要强调段落转换或制造张力时，可主动选择指板远端的Voicing以产生音色和音区的突变。", "evidence": "但若有意为之，通过更⼤的和弦跳跃也能实现有趣效果，因此不必将此视为必须严格遵守的规则", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0007:003", "chunk_id": "chunk_0007", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "chord:m9b5", "relation": "cautions", "target": "heuristic:prefer_m7b5_voicing", "knowledge_type": "Caution", "confidence": 0.9, "context_condition": "编配包含降五音的小调和声或半减七和弦语境时", "review_note": "教材明确指出 m9b5 指法极其复杂且难以演奏，建议在编曲中直接用 m7b5 替代。这是典型的基于吉他物理限制（手指跨度/按弦难度）的编曲简化策略，牺牲延伸音以换取可演奏性和声部清晰度。", "evidence": "小九降五和弦需要相当复杂的手指技巧来按弦...建议改用小七降五和弦的按法", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0008:001", "chunk_id": "chunk_0008", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "chord:sus4", "relation": "suggests", "target": "style:math_rock_harmony", "knowledge_type": "ColorEmotion", "confidence": 0.85, "context_condition": "在数学摇滚（Math Rock）风格中处理属功能和声或V级和弦时", "review_note": "在数学摇滚中，传统的属七和弦（V7）往往显得突兀或过于功能化。使用 Sus4 和弦替代属七和弦，可以消除强烈的解决倾向，获得更开放、现代且符合该流派审美特征的音响效果。", "evidence": "属和弦在数学摇滚风格中略显突兀，而改用挂四和弦后，整个进行更贴合我追求的声音效果", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0008:002", "chunk_id": "chunk_0008", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "chord:maj7", "relation": "conflicts_with", "target": "color:stable_resolution", "knowledge_type": "Caution", "confidence": 0.8, "context_condition": "需要营造稳定、无紧张感的收尾或平静段落时", "review_note": "大七和弦根音与七音构成的小九度音程（Minor 2nd interval across octaves）具有内在的不协和张力。若编曲目标是“完全解决”或“宁静”，应避免使用 Maj7，转而使用无七音的和弦以规避这种频段冲突。", "evidence": "大七和弦的根音与七度音之间构成小九度音程...会产生不协和音响", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0008:003", "chunk_id": "chunk_0008", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "chord:maj6", "relation": "enables", "target": "heuristic:substitute_maj7_for_stability", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.85, "context_condition": "希望保留大调和声色彩但去除大七和弦的尖锐张力时", "review_note": "六和弦（Major 6th）是 Major 7th 的理想替代品。它保留了扩展和弦的丰富色彩（相比大三和弦），但通过用六度音替换七度音，消除了根音与七音的小二度冲突，从而获得更温暖、稳定的听感。", "evidence": "大六和弦...能完美替代大七和弦来营造更稳定解决的音响效果...规避七度音程的使用", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0008:004", "chunk_id": "chunk_0008", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "chord:shell_voicing", "relation": "enables", "target": "heuristic:clarity_in_dense_arrangement", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.95, "context_condition": "编配合奏声部，尤其是当键盘、贝斯或其他吉他已占据中低频密集和声时", "review_note": "壳式和弦（1-3-7或1-7-3）通过省略五音和重复音，为其他乐器留出频谱空间，避免频段打架，是乐队编曲中的关键留白技巧。", "evidence": "在合奏场景中，当其他乐手已演奏密集和声时，使用壳式和弦...更为适宜", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0009:001", "chunk_id": "chunk_0009", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "chord:shell_voicing", "relation": "suggests", "target": "caution:distortion_muddy_low_freqs", "knowledge_type": "Caution", "confidence": 0.9, "context_condition": "使用高增益/失真音色演奏完整延伸和弦时", "review_note": "完整的大跨度延伸和弦在失真下易产生低频浑浊，壳式和弦因音符少、间距大，能保持失真音色的清晰度与力量感。", "evidence": "相比完整和弦，它们更适配增益音色...适当加入增益效果后，这些和弦会显得真挚而富有力量感", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0009:002", "chunk_id": "chunk_0009", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "chord:shell_voicing", "relation": "can_inspire", "target": "guitar_idiom:math_rock_riff_framework", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.85, "context_condition": "创作数学摇滚（Math Rock）或情绪摇滚（Emo）风格的分解和弦Riff时", "review_note": "壳式和弦提供了清晰的和声骨架，适合作为复杂节奏型或快速琶音Riff的基础，既保留调性又便于手指快速移动。", "evidence": "许多数学摇滚风格的乐队也广泛使用这些指型...作为即兴 riff 的基础框架", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0009:003", "chunk_id": "chunk_0009", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "chord:m7b5", "relation": "suggests", "target": "technique:omit_5th_for_functional_equivalence", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.8, "context_condition": "在需要简化指法或统一把位逻辑时，处理半减七和弦（m7b5）", "review_note": "由于壳式和弦本身省略五音，m7b5与m7在壳式结构下指型完全相同。编曲时可利用这一特性简化记忆和指法转换，依靠上下文确立和声功能。", "evidence": "小七降五和弦的壳式排列与小七和弦相同...只需正常使用壳式排列替代即可", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0009:004", "chunk_id": "chunk_0009", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "progression:iv_v_vi_i", "relation": "evokes", "target": "color:satisfying_resolution_uplift", "knowledge_type": "ColorEmotion", "confidence": 0.85, "context_condition": "构建歌曲结尾、副歌高潮或需要强烈回归感的段落", "review_note": "IV-V-vi-I进行具有明显的上行推动力和最终的完满解决感，适合营造振奋、满足的情绪终点。", "evidence": "带有令人满足的上升感，并在最后一个和弦上形成完满解决...非常适合用作歌曲结尾", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0009:005", "chunk_id": "chunk_0009", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "chord:borrowed_bIII", "relation": "evokes", "target": "color:surprise_modal_interchange", "knowledge_type": "ColorEmotion", "confidence": 0.8, "context_condition": "在大调进行中插入平行小调的bIII级大三和弦", "review_note": "用bIII替代预期的iii级小和弦，打破听众对自然音阶的惯性期待，产生明亮且出人意料的色彩转折。", "evidence": "基于第三音构建的小和弦...被替换为平行小调中借用的大三和弦...引入了出人意料的音响效果", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0009:006", "chunk_id": "chunk_0009", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "chord:borrowed_bVII_M7", "relation": "suggests", "target": "heuristic:resolve_diminished_tension", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.75, "context_condition": "希望缓解vii°减和弦带来的尖锐紧张感，同时保持半音阶进行的流畅性", "review_note": "用平行小调借来的bVII级大七和弦替代vii°减和弦，既能维持根音的半音上行线条，又能提供更柔和、现代的和声色彩。", "evidence": "减七和弦(vii°)被替换为平行小调...借来的大七和弦。这是缓解减和弦带来不必要紧张感的巧妙手法", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0009:007", "chunk_id": "chunk_0009", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "chord:6_9", "relation": "suggests", "target": "heuristic:substitute_dominant_softly", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.8, "context_condition": "需要属功能和声但不希望出现传统属七和弦的强烈解决倾向或冲突感时", "review_note": "6/9和弦可作为属七和弦的优雅替代，提供类似的和声张力但听感更平滑、爵士化，避免强烈的V-I解决需求。", "evidence": "6/9和弦是替代属七和弦效果的一个优雅解决方案", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0009:008", "chunk_id": "chunk_0009", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "chord:iv_minor", "relation": "evokes", "target": "color:borrowed_darkness", "knowledge_type": "ColorEmotion", "confidence": 0.9, "context_condition": "在大调歌曲创作中，需要引入短暂的情绪转折或色彩对比时", "review_note": "借用平行小调的 iv 级小和弦（如 G 大调中的 Cm）能瞬间打破大调的明亮感，提供‘离调’或‘忧郁’的色彩，是流行/摇滚编曲中极具表现力的和声工具。", "evidence": "C⼩调（iv级⼩和弦）是从平⾏⼩调G⼩调借来的...称为借⽤和弦", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0010:001", "chunk_id": "chunk_0010", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "pattern:octave_shape_low_strings", "relation": "constrains", "target": "interval:major_7th_dissonance", "knowledge_type": "Caution", "confidence": 0.95, "context_condition": "在 D 弦和 G 弦上构建八度音程（Octave Riff）时", "review_note": "吉他指板物理特性导致 D/G 弦组的八度指型间距（4品）与 E/A/D 弦组（3品）不同。若在 D/G 弦错误使用 3 品间距，会奏出极不协和的大七度而非八度，这是编写跨弦 Riff 时的常见陷阱。", "evidence": "若在D弦和G弦起始时误⽤三品间距（⽽非四品），会产⽣不和谐的⼤七度音程", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0010:002", "chunk_id": "chunk_0010", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "arpeggio:maj7", "relation": "enables", "target": "chord:maj6_maj9_sus", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.85, "context_condition": "为挂留、六和弦或九和弦编写即兴旋律线或填充乐句时", "review_note": "大七琶音具有高度的和声兼容性，可安全覆盖 Maj6、Maj9、Sus2/4 等未包含冲突延伸音的和弦，简化了为复杂和声编写 Solo 时的音符选择决策。", "evidence": "C⼤七琶音可应⽤于C⼤三和弦、C挂⼆或挂四和弦、C⼤六和弦、C⼤七和弦、C⼤九和弦等", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0010:003", "chunk_id": "chunk_0010", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "technique:tapping_phrasing", "relation": "cautions", "target": "caution:motif_repetition_limit", "knowledge_type": "Caution", "confidence": 0.8, "context_condition": "使用点弦技巧编写数学摇滚风格的独奏或 Riff 时", "review_note": "纯点弦乐句若仅基于少量音符变奏，容易显得单调且缺乏音乐性。编曲时应将其作为重复动机（Motif）使用，或必须与常规琶音/音阶混合，以打破机械感。", "evidence": "全部基于四个音符的变奏，创作空间较为有限...要么将这些短乐句作为重复动机使⽤，要么结合其他琶音与音阶", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0010:004", "chunk_id": "chunk_0010", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
{"source": "concept:math_rock_riff", "relation": "suggests", "target": "rhythm:mixed_meter_grouping", "knowledge_type": "GuitarIdiom", "confidence": 0.85, "context_condition": "创作具有数学摇滚特征的吉他 Riff 时", "review_note": "通过非常规节拍组合（如 3+4 拍或三连音分组）来构建 Riff，不仅能增强节奏驱动力，还能让复杂的快速和弦转换在听觉上更具逻辑性和可预测性。", "evidence": "采⽤了快速和弦转换与非常规节拍...若将第⼀⼩节视为三拍与四拍的组合...会更容易理解", "needs_visual_context": false, "provenance": {"review_id": "mathrock_pdf_steve_h:chunk_0010:005", "chunk_id": "chunk_0010", "page_hint": null, "review_decision": "accept", "revision_status": "accepted", "ingested_at": "2026-06-01T11:06:04.872326+00:00", "source_review_file": "data\\processed\\mathrock\\pdf_kg_extract\\arrangement_kg_review.jsonl"}}
